flowchart TD
  A[Mic PCM16 16 kHz over WS binary] --> B{Agent speaking?}
  B -->|yes below barge-in| GATE[Gate mic avoid self-answer loop]
  GATE --> A
  B -->|yes barge-in| INT[Interrupt stop TTS return floor]
  INT --> C
  B -->|no| C[Silero VAD 576 sample window D-10]
  C --> D[Segmenter 320ms preroll 800ms silence]
  D --> E{Utterance ended?}
  E -->|no| F{Teaching and 4s stall?}
  F -->|yes| HINT[Hesitation hint via LLM]
  F -->|no| A
  E -->|yes| STT[STT Faster-Whisper or Groq]
  STT --> LLM[LLM stream with mode prompt]
  LLM --> CH[Sentence chunker first clause at comma]
  CH --> TTS[TTS Kokoro stream]
  TTS --> OUT[PCM16 24 kHz heard before LLM finishes]
  HINT --> CH
  OUT --> TEL[Queue telemetry off hot path]
  TEL --> DB[(SQLite turns)]
  STT --> UROW[User turn text stt_ms hesitation]
  OUT --> AROW[Assistant turn llm tts e2e correction]
  UROW --> DB
  AROW --> DB
